00:37:59.720 --> 00:38:02.440
I liked the feel of the place, and the fries were great.
我挺喜欢那里的氛围，薯条也很棒。

00:38:02.920 --> 00:38:07.580
What wasn't so great was that Carl's brother had been laid off just ten minutes before we arrived.
不太妙的是，卡尔的兄弟在我们到达前十分钟刚被解雇。

00:38:07.820 --> 00:38:10.610
