00:38:19.360 --> 00:38:20.620
A trollop is what she was.
她就是个水性杨花的女人。

00:38:20.620 --> 00:38:21.520
Hey, now.
嘿，等等。

00:38:21.960 --> 00:38:24.240
Enough blush on her cheeks to cover the moon.
她脸上的腮红浓得能把月亮遮住。

00:38:24.440 --> 00:38:26.360
And that business about the airfield?
还有关于机场的那档子事？

00:38:26.520 --> 00:38:28.220
It wasn't an airfield, but a...
那根本不是机场，而是一个……

00:38:31.580 --> 00:38:32.540
Military base.
军事基地。

00:38:32.660 --> 00:38:36.400
You saw all those soldiers prancing behind that barbed wire fence.
你看到那些在铁丝网后面耀武扬威的士兵了吗。

00:38:36.640 --> 00:38:40.980
The girl dropped us off and drove away laughing, because that's what whores do.
那女孩把我们放下后大笑着开车走了，因为婊子就是会那样做。

00:38:41.390 --> 00:38:42.460
She was a prostitute.
她是个妓女。

00:38:42.890 --> 00:38:43.460
She was a trollop.
她是个荡妇。

00:38:43.860 --> 00:38:46.760
